<%--
Author_Meta_Row - a "who + when" byline: avatar + author + relative time (+ actions)

$name (string)          - the author's name; seeds the Person_Avatar it renders [required]
$avatar_url (nullable)  - the author's profile image [optional]
$initials (string)      - explicit avatar initials override [optional]

<Slot:author>  - the author line: a name (may be a link, may carry an inline email) [required]
<Slot:time>    - a relative/absolute timestamp, right-aligned [optional]
<Slot:actions> - a trailing action (e.g. a menu) [optional]

The shared byline PRIMITIVE for authored posts (a request-thread message, a comment,
a note). Domain widgets keep their own wrappers and render their byline through this
one row - converge the shape, not the widgets (guide 6.5). DISTINCT from Feed_Row
(a single-line "actor did thing" event with an icon tile, no avatar).

Usage:
    <Author_Meta_Row $name=_m.author_name $avatar_url=_m.avatar_url>
        <Slot:author><strong><%= _m.author_name %></strong></Slot:author>
        <Slot:time><%= Rsx_Time.relative(_m.created_at) %></Slot:time>
    </Author_Meta_Row>
--%>
<Define:Author_Meta_Row tag="div">
    <Person_Avatar $name="<%= str(this.args.name) %>" $avatar_url="<%= str(this.args.avatar_url) %>" $initials="<%= str(this.args.initials) %>" $size="md" />
    <div class="Author_Meta_Row__author"><%= content('author') %></div>
    <% if (this.args._slots && this.args._slots.time) { %>
        <div class="Author_Meta_Row__time"><%= content('time') %></div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (this.args._slots && this.args._slots.actions) { %>
        <div class="Author_Meta_Row__actions"><%= content('actions') %></div>
    <% } %>
</Define:Author_Meta_Row>
